{"schema_version":11,"path":"cairn.blueprint","source":"# Cairn — the framework described as a Cairn project.\n#\n# Promoted from tests/fixtures/cairn-bootstrap/ and updated to match\n# the real source tree as of 2026-05-11.\n\nSystem Cairn \"Graph, decisions, and gates keeping extreme AI-agent software development maintainable, investigable, extendable, and fit for its purpose\" id \"cairn\" @framework {\n    decisions \"./meta/decisions\"\n    research \"./meta/research\"\n    sources \"./meta/sources\"\n    todos \"./meta/todos\"\n\n    Module Root \"Crate entry points, shared error types, and verification\" id \"cairn.root\" {\n        path \"./src/main.rs\"\n        path \"./src/lib.rs\"\n        path \"./src/error.rs\"\n        path \"./src/verification.rs\"\n        path \"./src/signal.rs\"\n        path \"./src/copy.rs\"\n        path \"./src/report.rs\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/root.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Persist \"Shared file-persistence helpers: atomic writes and versioned JSON state files\" id \"cairn.persist\" @no-contract {\n        path \"./src/persist.rs\"\n    }\n\n    Module State \"Pluggable state persistence backend\" id \"cairn.state\" {\n        path \"./src/state\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/state.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Watch \"Watch mode: periodic scan with finding-change events\" id \"cairn.watch\" {\n        path \"./src/watch.rs\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/watch.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Workspace \"Multi-project workspace aggregation (cairn.workspace)\" id \"cairn.workspace\" {\n        path \"./src/workspace\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/workspace.md\"\n    }\n    Container Kernel \"Domain-agnostic core\" id \"cairn.kernel\" @kernel {\n        decisions \"./meta/decisions\"\n\n        Module Blueprint \"Parses .blueprint files into AST node graph\" id \"cairn.kernel.blueprint\" {\n            path \"./src/blueprint\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.blueprint.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module Artefacts \"Typed artefact registry and contract loader\" id \"cairn.kernel.artefacts\" {\n            path \"./src/artefacts\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.artefacts.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module Map \"Graph construction, integrity checks, and query traversal\" id \"cairn.kernel.map\" {\n            path \"./src/map\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.map.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module Scanner \"Orchestrates parse, reconcile, and graph-build pipeline\" id \"cairn.kernel.scanner\" {\n            path \"./src/scanner\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.scanner.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module Changes \"Change directories, delta semantics, and archive\" id \"cairn.kernel.changes\" {\n            path \"./src/changes\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.changes.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module Hooks \"Commit and task-boundary enforcement gates\" id \"cairn.kernel.hooks\" {\n            path \"./src/hooks\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.hooks.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module QueryAPI \"Structured query handlers and serialisation\" id \"cairn.kernel.query\" {\n            path \"./src/query_api\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.query.md\"\n        }\n\n        Module CLI \"Primary user surface and output formatting\" id \"cairn.kernel.cli\" {\n            path \"./src/cli\"\n            path \"./tools/agent-pack\"\n            contract \"./meta/contracts/kernel.cli.md\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    Module CodeReconciler \"Tree-sitter reconciler for Rust, TypeScript, Python, Go\" id \"cairn.reconcile\" @reconciler @code {\n        path \"./src/reconcile\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/reconcile.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module UI \"Read-only web graph explorer and API server\" id \"cairn.ui\" @ui {\n        path \"./src/ui\"\n        path \"./src/ui_assets\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/ui.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module MCP \"MCP tool wrapper over query API\" id \"cairn.mcp\" @integration {\n        path \"./src/mcp\"\n        path \"./src/bin/cairn-mcp.rs\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/mcp.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module LSP \"LSP diagnostics server for OMP integration\" id \"cairn.lsp\" @integration {\n        path \"./src/lsp\"\n        path \"./src/bin/cairn-lsp.rs\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/lsp.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Macros \"Proc-macro crate for compile-time attributes\" id \"cairn.macros\" @build @no-test-coverage {\n        path \"./cairn-macros\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/macros.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Brownfield \"Orphan grouping, candidate heuristics, and onboard analysis\" id \"cairn.brownfield\" {\n        path \"./src/brownfield\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/brownfield.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Provenance \"Trace sidecar primitives for the provenance chain\" id \"cairn.provenance\" {\n        path \"./src/provenance\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/provenance.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module SuggestedEdges \"Suggested-edges queue: mutable triage workflows for AI-suggested graph edges\" id \"cairn.suggested-edges\" {\n        path \"./src/suggested_edges\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/suggested-edges.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Summariser \"LLM-assisted summarisation backend and request queue\" id \"cairn.summariser\" {\n        path \"./src/summariser\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/summariser.md\"\n    }\n\n    Module Tests \"Integration and smoke tests\" id \"cairn.tests\" @test @no-test-coverage {\n        path \"./tests\"\n        contract \"./meta/contracts/tests.md\"\n    }\n}\n\n# Core data flow: scanner is the orchestration hub\ncairn.kernel.scanner    -> cairn.kernel.blueprint   \"Parses blueprint files\"\ncairn.kernel.scanner    -> cairn.kernel.artefacts   \"Loads artefact metadata\"\ncairn.kernel.scanner    -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Builds graph from parsed output\"\ncairn.kernel.scanner    -> cairn.reconcile          \"Invokes registered reconcilers\"\ncairn.kernel.scanner    -> cairn.state            \"Reads beads to flag orphan node labels\"\n\n# Map consumes parser and artefact output\ncairn.kernel.map        -> cairn.kernel.blueprint   \"Consumes parsed AST\"\ncairn.kernel.map        -> cairn.kernel.artefacts   \"Validates contracts against code\"\n\n# Enforcement gates\ncairn.kernel.hooks      -> cairn.kernel.scanner     \"Gates commits on scan integrity\"\ncairn.kernel.hooks      -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Reads findings\"\ncairn.kernel.changes    -> cairn.kernel.scanner     \"Validates deltas before archive\"\ncairn.kernel.changes    -> cairn.kernel.blueprint   \"Parses blueprint deltas\"\ncairn.kernel.changes    -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Reads graph state\"\n\n# Query and presentation surfaces\ncairn.kernel.cli        -> cairn.kernel.query       \"Exposes queries as CLI commands\"\ncairn.kernel.cli        -> cairn.kernel.scanner     \"Orchestrates scan runs\"\ncairn.kernel.cli        -> cairn.kernel.hooks       \"Runs hook checks\"\ncairn.kernel.cli        -> cairn.ui                 \"Launches graph explorer\"\ncairn.kernel.query      -> cairn.kernel.scanner     \"Reads scan state\"\ncairn.kernel.query      -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Traverses graph\"\ncairn.kernel.query      -> cairn.kernel.changes     \"Reads change state\"\ncairn.kernel.query      -> cairn.kernel.hooks       \"Reads hook findings\"\ncairn.ui                -> cairn.kernel.scanner     \"Runs scans for API responses\"\ncairn.ui                -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Serves graph data\"\ncairn.ui                -> cairn.state            \"Reads node-linked beads for the inspector\"\ncairn.mcp               -> cairn.kernel.query       \"Wraps queries as MCP tools\"\n\n# Pluggable reconciler reports back to graph\ncairn.reconcile         -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Reports findings to graph\"\n\n# Brownfield onboard consumes scanner findings\ncairn.brownfield        -> cairn.kernel.map         \"Reads orphan findings\"\ncairn.kernel.cli        -> cairn.brownfield         \"Dispatches onboard command\"\n"}